[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0105","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50316","title":"Linux Kernel OrangeFS 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 OrangeFS 文件系统驱动中的 orangefs_sysfs_init() 函数存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401），当加载并卸载 orangefs 内核模块时，动态分配的 kobject 对象未能正确释放，导致内核内存持续泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复插入和移除该模块触发此漏洞，造成系统内核内存资源耗尽，最终导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50316"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:13Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.16/6.1.2 及以上版本，或合入补丁 commit 1f2c0e8a587b（6.0.y）/224094902941（6.1.y）/9ce4ba7fff5a（主线）。如果无法立即升级，可通过 `modprobe -r orangefs` 卸载 orangefs 模块，并禁止自动加载（在 /etc/modprobe.d/ 中添加 blacklist orangefs）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1f2c0e8a587bcafad85019a2d80f158d8d41a868","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/22409490294180c39be7dd0e5b2667d41556307d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9ce4ba7fff5af36da82dc5964221367630621b99","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50316.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50316.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50316","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50316.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50316.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/08/seguranca/cve-2022-50316-orangefs-fix-kmemleak-in-orangefs-s-1765244260000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-3884-hc6c-jwpv/GHSA-3884-hc6c-jwpv.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50316","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50316.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50316"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0105.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0104","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50304","title":"Linux Kernel MTD 核心模块资源泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MTD（Memory Technology Device）子系统的 init_mtd() 函数存在资源泄漏漏洞。在模块初始化过程中，若 init_mtdchar() 调用失败，mtd_bdi 未能正确注销，导致后续重新加载 mtd 模块时因设备名冲突而失败。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞触发拒绝服务（需具备模块加载权限），影响使用 Linux 内核 MTD 子系统的系统。CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50304"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.2 及以上版本，或更新至发行版已包含该修复的内核包（如 5.10.163、5.15.88、6.1.6）。无法立即升级时，可临时卸载 mtd 内核模块（modprobe -r mtd）并黑名单加载（echo \"blacklist mtd\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf），避免在受影响的模块环境中重载触发资源泄漏。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1aadf01e5076b9ab6bf294b9622335c651314895","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/26c304a3f136009c5a2a04e2bf3ac6aa25aabcb4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/78816504100cbd8e6836df9f58cc4fbb8b262f1c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50304.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50304.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50304","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50304.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50304.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/05/seguranca/cve-2022-50304-mtd-core-fix-possible-resource-leak-1764982887000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-x78r-fcw5-873j/GHSA-x78r-fcw5-873j.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50304","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71350.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6cf3413a0dc58cfa9353d85292d9cdccd3e56f93/2022/CVE-2022-50304.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0104.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0103","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0103.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50303","title":"Linux kernel DRM/AMDKFD 计算PASID双重释放漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AMDGPU 驱动的 DRM/AMDKFD 子系统中存在双重释放漏洞（CWE-415）。当 `kfd_process_device_init_vm` 在虚拟内存转换为计算 VM 并设置 PASID 后失败时，由于未正确持有 `pdd->drm_file` 引用计数，导致 drm 关闭文件处理程序与 KFD 进程销毁工作线程可能同时释放同一计算 PASID，引发内核空指针解引用或 IDR 释放警告。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成系统崩溃或潜在权限提升，影响使用 AMDGPU 驱动的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50303"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:41Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:11Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.19、6.1.5 或 6.2 及以上版本，其中已包含 `amdgpu_amdkfd_gpuvm_set_vm_pasid` 助手函数的修复补丁，防止 KFD 进程在 vm 初始化失败时因未持有 pdd->drm_file 引用导致同一 compute pasid 被双重释放。无法立即升级的发行版可向后移植提交 `1a799c4c190e` / `89f0d766c9e3` / `a02c07b61989` 到受影响内核源码树中 `drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdgpu/` 和 `drivers/gpu/drm/amd/amdkfd/` 对应文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1a799c4c190ea9f0e81028e3eb3037ed0ab17ff5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/89f0d766c9e3fdeafbed6f855d433c2768cde862","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a02c07b619899179384fde06f951530438a3512d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50303.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50303.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50303","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50303.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50303.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/05/seguranca/cve-2022-50303-drmamdkfd-fix-double-release-comput-1764982882000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-ppmr-4j3r-434x/GHSA-ppmr-4j3r-434x.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50303","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50303.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50303"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0103.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0102","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50266","title":"Linux Kernel kprobes 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 kprobes 动态追踪机制中的 `kill_kprobe()` 函数存在检查顺序缺陷，在调用 `disarm_kprobe_ftrace()` 之前先设置了 `KPROBE_FLAG_GONE` 标志，导致探针启用状态的判断始终为假，无法正确执行探针禁用流程。本地攻击者可以利用此缺陷触发空指针解引用（CWE-476），造成系统崩溃拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，需本地低权限用户访问且具备 kprobe 操作能力，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50266"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:06Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：4.5+、4.10+、4.15+、4.20+、5.5+、5.9+、6.0.16+ 或 6.1.2+。对于无法立即升级内核的系统，可应用对应稳定分支的补丁：`0c76ef3f26d5`（4.4）、`c909985dd0c0`（4.9）、`f20a067f1310`（4.14）；可通过关闭 `CONFIG_KPROBES` 内核编译选项禁用 kprobes 功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0c76ef3f26d5ef2ac2c21b47e7620cff35809fbb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c909985dd0c0f74b61e3f8f0e04bf8aa9c8b97c7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f20a067f13106565816b4b6a6b665b2088a63824","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50266.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50266.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50266","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50266.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50266.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/03/seguranca/cve-2022-50266-kprobes-fix-check-for-probe-enabled-1764810084000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-gcqm-mw5p-q5gh/GHSA-gcqm-mw5p-q5gh.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50266","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50266.json","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/en/security-disclosure/2026/2026-03.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0101","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50260","title":"Linux Kernel MSM DRM 子系统关机流程不一致导致内核崩溃漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MSM DRM 驱动程序中存在空指针解引用漏洞，由于驱动组件的 .remove 和 .shutdown 回调在硬件关闭逻辑上不一致，当 GPU 子设备探测失败导致 .bind 回调未执行时，系统关机过程中将调用 drm_atomic_helper_shutdown() 对未初始化的 DRM 设备进行操作，尝试获取未初始化的互斥锁，进而触发内核空指针解引用导致系统崩溃。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞通过构造特定硬件状态触发内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核使用 MSM DRM 驱动的 Qualcomm 平台系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50260"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:05Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至已修复版本：5.19.17、6.0.3 或 6.1 及以上。对于使用 5.9 至 5.19.x 分支的系统，升级到 5.19.17 或更高版本；对于使用 6.0.x 分支的系统，升级到 6.0.3 或更高版本。若无法立即升级内核，可在系统关闭前手动禁用 msm DRM 驱动模块（rmmod msm 或在 modprobe.d 中黑名单 msm 模块），避免 shutdown 阶段触发空指针解引用导致内核恐慌。发行版用户可通过各自的包管理器（如 apt upgrade linux-image / dnf update kernel）安装已包含补丁的内核版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a58d2ae572adaec8d046f8d35b40c2c32ac7468","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0e6649a2e31ac157c711d583ec8f5ec59da5de0e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/26f9a766f87b33c50ed400a9500cc1dc9aced953","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50260.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50260.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50260","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50260.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50260.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-wv25-jjx7-r2r4/GHSA-wv25-jjx7-r2r4.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50260","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50260.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50260","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/mariner-vulnerability/osv/AZL-70768.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0100","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50256","title":"Linux Linux内核meson DRM驱动使用后释放内存漏洞","description":"Linux内核DRM Meson显示驱动存在释放后使用漏洞。meson_encoder_hdmi_init和meson_encoder_cvbs_init函数在初始化时向全局bridge_list注册DRM桥接器，但在驱动模块卸载时未手动移除这些桥接器，导致全局链表中残留指向已释放内存的悬挂指针。当驱动模块重新加载时，drm_bridge_add函数遍历全局bridge_list会访问已释放的内存，触发use-after-free。该漏洞影响Linux 4.10至5.19.16及6.0至6.0.2版本，攻击者需具备本地低权限即可利用，可能造成权限提升或内核代码执行，CVSS评分7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50256"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:36Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:05Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.19.17、6.0.3 或更高版本，包含对应 git commit de2b6ebe0cb7/fc1fd114dde3/09847723c12f。若无法立即升级，可在加载 meson_drm 模块前通过 blacklist 禁止自动加载（/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf 中添加 blacklist meson_drm），或在内核编译时取消 CONFIG_DRM_MESON 选项以移除受影响驱动模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/09847723c12fc2753749cec3939a02ee92dac468","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de2b6ebe0cb7746b5b6b35d79e150d934392b958","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fc1fd114dde3d2623ac37676df3d74ffeedb0da8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50256.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50256.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50256","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50256.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50256.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-qh76-9567-4h37/GHSA-qh76-9567-4h37.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50256","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50256.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/Avis/CERTFR-2025-AVI-1070","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50256"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0099","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50236","title":"Linux Kernel MediaTek IOMMU 未初始化内存访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 MediaTek IOMMU 驱动中存在未初始化资源使用漏洞（CWE-908）。当系统通过 kexec() 热重启时，中断处理程序（ISR）可能在 IOMMU 域初始化完成前被触发，导致内核访问未初始化的内存地址，引发系统崩溃。本地攻击者可在低权限条件下利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 4.6 至 6.0.17 及 6.1 至 6.1.3 版本，已在对应稳定分支中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50236"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T14:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit 构成（如 v5.10+ 对应补丁集）的版本。各发行版请安装对应安全更新：Ubuntu 安装 `linux-image-*` 至 5.10/5.15 HWE 最新版，Debian 升级至 6.1+，RHEL/CentOS 安装 kernel 安全 errata。如无法立即更新，可临时通过 kernel 命令行添加 `modprobe.blacklist=mtk_iommu` 禁用 MediaTek IOMMU 驱动缓解，但会丧失 IOMMU 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/00ef8885a945c37551547d8ac8361cacd20c4e42","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/85cc8a187f2de7a91e2cea522e9406fa12999269","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f13acee780cedb3e06a6dadf64d9104cccd2b9fc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50236.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50236.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50236","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50236.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50236.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-mj99-x9w6-h3m8/GHSA-mj99-x9w6-h3m8.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50236","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50236.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2022-50236","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/fb27339bf790f38603dcf52a87a4652cadb30c7e/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/suse/gb_sles_2025_4189_1.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0098","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0098.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50233","title":"Linux Kernel Bluetooth EIR 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统的 EIR（扩展查询响应）处理函数中存在未初始化内存访问漏洞。由于 dev_name 和 short_name 字段不保证以 NULL 结尾，驱动使用 strlen() 计算长度时可能越界读取内核堆内存，导致敏感信息泄露。本地攻击者可通过蓝牙协议发起特制查询请求触发此漏洞，影响使用 Linux 内核蓝牙功能的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核主线已合入修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50233"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-08-09T15:15:27Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.0 及以上版本，或向后移植补丁 commit dd7b8cdde098 到当前内核并重新编译。如无法升级，可通过 `rmmod bluetooth` 禁用蓝牙模块或通过 `rfkill block bluetooth` 阻止蓝牙加载作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd7b8cdde098cf9f7c8de409b5b7bbb98f97be80","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2022/CVE-2022-50233.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50233.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50233.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50233","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2022/UBUNTU-CVE-2022-50233.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50233.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/430f582ded680f823d28636f80d8cb58f1c3d8cd/2022/CVE-2022-50233.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/08/GHSA-m5mr-p52m-vp72/GHSA-m5mr-p52m-vp72.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50233","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70474.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0098.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0097","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50232","title":"Linux Linux内核 arm64 页表权限访问拒绝漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 arm64 架构中的 swapper 页表项未设置 UXN（非特权执行永不）权限位，当系统支持 FEAT_EPAN 特性时，idmap 页表的读/写访问被拒绝，导致访问 __idmap_kpti_flag 时触发内核 panic，造成本地拒绝服务。该漏洞影响支持 FEAT_EPAN 特性的 arm64 平台上的 Linux 内核，攻击者需具备本地用户权限。该问题已在内核上游版本 c3cee924bd85 的代码重构中被修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50232"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:02Z","remediation":"建议将 Linux 内核升级至以下包含修复的版本：主线 v5.19-rc1 及以上（合入 commit c3cee924bd85），或稳定分支 v5.18.5+、v5.15.48+、v5.10.125+、v5.4.200+、v4.19.248+、v4.14.284+、v4.9.319+、v4.4.319+。如无法升级，可在内核启动参数中添加 \"arm64.nopauth\" 禁用 FEAT_EPAN 作为临时缓解措施，但会降低硬件安全特性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/775871d4be0d75e219cca937af843a4a1b60489a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c3cee924bd855184d15bc4aa6088dcf8e2c1394c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50232.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50232.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50232","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50232.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50232.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-7m8m-mqvx-9vwv/GHSA-7m8m-mqvx-9vwv.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50232.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50232","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50232.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/fb27339bf790f38603dcf52a87a4652cadb30c7e/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/huawei/gb_euleros_sa_2025_2012.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0096","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0096.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50230","title":"Linux kernel arm64 页表 UXN 权限遗漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 arm64 架构的 swapper 页表项中缺少 UXN（非特权执行禁止）位设置，在支持 FEAT_EPAN 内存权限隔离特性的系统上，内核启动时访问 __idmap_kpti_flag 会因 idmap 页表权限检查失败而触发内核崩溃（panic），导致本地拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 arm64 架构版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等，攻击者需具备本地系统访问权限。修复已在主线内核提交 c3cee924bd85 中合入。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50230"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:01Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至包含 commit c3cee924bd85 的版本（主线 v5.18+，或对应发行版如 Debian 已 backport 的内核包），或在启动参数添加 `kpti=off` 作为临时缓解措施（会降低 KPTI 保护）。无法立即升级时，可手动 backport 设置 swapper PTE 中 UXN 位的补丁后重新编译内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9283e708a9b8529e7aafac9ab5c5c79a9fab8846","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c3cee924bd855184d15bc4aa6088dcf8e2c1394c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50230.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50230.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50230","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50230.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50230.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2022-50230-arm64-set-uxn-on-swapper-page-table-1771408735000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-4wvm-jj6w-gv33/GHSA-4wvm-jj6w-gv33.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50230","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-70471.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50230.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0096.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0095","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50224","title":"Linux KVM x86 内存管理单元 NX 位处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 KVM 虚拟化子系统中，x86 内存管理单元（MMU）在处理嵌套页表（NPT）时存在缺陷。当 NX 巨页缓解机制启用时，KVM 会在影子页表项（SPTE）中设置 NX 位，但代码未将该位视为 NPT 的有效位，导致其被误判为保留位而触发内核 WARN 警告。本地攻击者可通过在虚拟机内触发特定内存操作序列（如使用 NX 巨页映射）引发宿主机内核崩溃，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响使用 AMD SVM 虚拟化且启用 NX 巨页缓解的 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50224"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:53Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本（如 5.10.170+、5.15.95+、6.1.13+），其中已包含将 NX 位视为 NPT 有效 SPTE 位的补丁。如无法立即升级内核，可临时关闭 NX 巨页缓解（npt=0）或禁用 NPT 嵌套分页功能作为变通措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6271f2854b9233702e236e576b885a876dde4889","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6c6ab524cfae0799e55c82b2c1d61f1af0156f8d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50224.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50224.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50224","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50224.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50224.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-74p4-jx54-j5rv/GHSA-74p4-jx54-j5rv.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50224.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50224","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c370371a248191a76d0098a9385b7d74a632f2ca/2022/CVE-2022-50224.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0094","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50195","title":"Linux Linux 内核拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ARM 架构 Qualcomm 平台设备树中存在时钟引用缺陷，gcc 驱动未将 PXO_SRC 注册为固定时钟，导致驱动在尝试使用该时钟源时触发内核崩溃（kernel panic）。本地攻击者可通过加载受影响驱动造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 QCOM DTS 的 ARM Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50195"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:50Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:57Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.2 或更高版本（如 6.x 主线）；无法升级时，可反向移植提交 0a4fa4ce6979 或 eb9e93937756 到内核代码中，具体修改为在 arch/arm/boot/dts/qcom-ipq8064.dtsi 中将 gcc PXO phandle 替换为 pxo_board 固定时钟声明。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0a4fa4ce697987b71eafce17bb198961ed9070bd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eb9e93937756a05787977875830c0dc482cb57e0","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50195.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50195.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50195","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50195.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50195.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-vpq5-x7gr-w285/GHSA-vpq5-x7gr-w285.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50195.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50195","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c370371a248191a76d0098a9385b7d74a632f2ca/2022/CVE-2022-50195.json","https://github.com/gardenlinux/glvd-contrib/blob/3284960fe3981bd0a94adf30322ee58ba7078520/parse-changelog/vulnerable-cves"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0093","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0093.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50167","title":"Linux Kernel BPF 32位整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 BPF 子系统在处理 ARRAY 类型 map 元素访问时存在整数溢出漏洞。当 BPF 数组 map 大小超过 4GB 时，由于 index 和 elem_size 均为 u32 类型，元素指针计算会产生 32 位整数溢出，导致内核内存访问越界。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 BPF 程序触发此漏洞，可能造成信息泄露或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。Linux 社区已通过强制 64 位乘法运算来修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50167"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:53Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.18、5.19.2 及以上版本，或 cherry-pick 补丁 87ac0d600943 至内核源码树。如无法升级内核，可通过 BPF 程序限制避免创建超过 4GB 的 ARRAY map，以降低触发整数溢出的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/063e092534d4c6785228e5b1eb6e9329f66ccbe4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3c7256b880b3a5aa1895fd169a34aa4224a11862","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/87ac0d600943994444e24382a87aa19acc4cd3d4","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50167.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50167.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50167","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50167.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50167.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-mrhw-xcq4-7jw7/GHSA-mrhw-xcq4-7jw7.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50167.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50167","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c370371a248191a76d0098a9385b7d74a632f2ca/2022/CVE-2022-50167.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0093.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0092","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0092.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50166","title":"Linux Kernel Bluetooth HCI 工作队列竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核蓝牙子系统存在工作队列处理缺陷，当 HCI 命令、事件和数据包处理工作队列被排空（drain）以避免死锁时，延迟工作（超时处理函数）仍会向已排空的工作队列提交命令，导致蓝牙控制器命令超时并触发内核警告。该漏洞源于 CWE-667 不正确的锁处理，攻击者可通过蓝牙通信触发此竞态条件，造成系统拒绝服务（DoS）。影响使用受影响 Linux 内核版本的系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50166"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:53Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Linux 内核升级至 5.18.18（5.18.x 分支）、5.19.2（5.19.x 分支）或 6.0 及以上版本。对于无法升级内核的情况，可手工 cherry-pick 以下内核补丁：4bf367fa1fef、3b3825557065、877afadad2dc，这些提交新增 HCI_DRAIN_WQ 标志位，防止工作队列排干期间入队超时任务。无其他有效缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3b382555706558f5c0587862b6dc03e96a252bba","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4bf367fa1fefabdf14938d0ac9ed60020389112e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/877afadad2dce8aae1f2aad8ce47e072d4f6165e","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50166.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50166.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50166","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50166.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50166.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-qxmr-4p8x-2r7c/GHSA-qxmr-4p8x-2r7c.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50166.html","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50166","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50166.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Vuln-Intro/Data_Crawling/nvd/linux_kernel_cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0092.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0091","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0091.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50163","title":"Linux 内核 ax25 设备引用计数错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 AX.25 协议栈中的设备引用跟踪（dev_tracker）存在缺陷，一个 ax25_dev 可被多个 ax25_cb 结构体同时使用，但内核未正确为每个 ax25_cb 分配独立的 dev_tracker，导致在 ax25_release 释放套接字时引用计数器出现不一致，触发内核引用跟踪警告并可能造成系统崩溃。本地攻击者可通过创建并释放多个 AX.25 套接字来利用此漏洞，影响使用 Linux AX.25 协议栈的系统，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50163"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-06-18T11:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:22:53Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 5.18.18、5.19.2 或更高版本；LTS 分支用户升级至 5.15.35、5.10.112、5.4.190、4.19.240 或 4.14.277 及以上版本。如无法立即升级且未使用业余无线电功能，可执行 `echo \"blacklist ax25\" > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-ax25.conf && update-initramfs -u` 禁用 ax25 内核模块作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4294df1374450912b2f64ee3cf575069fc784679","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d08e3d71e5942f77fbff7f3529ed7fc82fbb3dfa","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d7c4c9e075f8cc6d88d277bc24e5d99297f03c06","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50163.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50163","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50163.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50163.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50163.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2022-50163.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/06/GHSA-qv7x-xghp-vpfc/GHSA-qv7x-xghp-vpfc.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50163","https://github.com/fderuiter/lambda-wave/blob/352d151151b3004e320d909f59dc8b1fa30f2838/.trivyignore","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50163.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"ht